# Applies only to builds whose context is the repository root. The service images build from
# frontend/, backend/ and gpu-worker/ (each with its own .dockerignore), so nothing uses the
# root context today; this keeps the history and the Android project out if one ever does.
.git
android/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/build
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.gradle
**/.kotlin
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.local.example
*.log
